\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960974086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960984893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107385#issuecomment-2960984893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107385","id":2960984893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wfQs9","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T01:45:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T01:45:42Z","body":"@Alex2782 The check could probably be removed, but it's fine either way. The logic in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1bbfe637c62d48dd455562bf2bc24d92e6ba9ade/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/utils/PermissionsUtil.java#L119 validates the permission is `DANGEROUS` before requesting it, so it's a `NORMAL` permission, then the request is a no-op.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960984893/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2961529205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107385#issuecomment-2961529205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107385","id":2961529205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6whVl1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T07:21:02Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T07:21:57Z","body":"Shouldn't we output a more user-friendly error than just forwarding an exception if the issue is just that the permission wasn't set?\r\n\r\nAnd shouldn't there be a way to request a \"normal\" permission so that this code can work instead of failing with an exception?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2961529205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2961565400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107385#issuecomment-2961565400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107385","id":2961565400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6whebY","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T07:35:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T07:37:38Z","body":"> Shouldn't we output a more user-friendly error than just forwarding an exception if the issue is just that the permission wasn't set?\r\n\r\nI think, exception clearly indicates the error: `Neither user 10717 nor current process has android.permission.VIBRATE.` but yeah a message can be added like \"Needs to enable VIBRATE permission in export preset to use vibration\" or something similar.\r\n\r\n> And shouldn't there be a way to request a \"normal\" permission so that this code can work instead of failing with an exception?\r\n\r\nNormal permissions cannot be requested at runtime. They need to be declared in the manifest (by selecting in export preset) and are granted by default.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2961565400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963126062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107385#issuecomment-2963126062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107385","id":2963126062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wnbcu","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T14:45:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T10:39:35Z","body":"> a more user-friendly error\r\n\r\nnow: `SecurityException: VIBRATE permission not granted. Make sure it is declared in the manifest and enabled in the export preset.`\r\n\r\n<details><summary>logcat</summary>\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\n`adb logcat -s Godot`\r\n\r\n``` java\r\n06-11 16:40:25.546  3811  3864 V Godot   : OnGodotSetupCompleted\r\n06-11 16:40:25.557  3811  3864 W Godot   : SecurityException: VIBRATE permission not granted. Make sure it is declared in the manifest and enabled in the export preset.\r\n06-11 16:40:25.557  3811  3864 V Godot   : OnGodotMainLoopStarted\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963126062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968133402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107385#issuecomment-2968133402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107385","id":2968133402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w6h8a","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T20:57:04Z","updated_at":"2025